    supplied. (Sashiko)
    https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260828164950.61AE51F000E9@smtp.kernel.org/
  - Use READ_ONCE()/WRITE_ONCE() for IRQ mode accessed by shared handlers
    and drain the channel IRQ before restoring local routing. (Sashiko)

