On Tue,  1 Sep 2026 00:51:27 +0300 Anton Danilov wrote:
>  	const struct iphdr *iph = ip_hdr(skb);
> +	enum skb_drop_reason reason = SKB_DROP_REASON_NOT_SPECIFIED;
